{"id":"a2ddf661b9365da2","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-focusing.md","title":"Focusing","display":"df-focusing — Focusing","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-focusing","aliases":["72-df-focusing"],"display":"df-focusing — Focusing","depends_on":["[[72-df-linear-logic]]","[[72-df-types-inference-closure]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified","source_location":"Supplement: Andreoli, Logic Programming with Focusing Proofs in Linear Logic, JLC 2(3) (1992) 297–347, author manuscript pp.8–12, Fig.4, Theorems1–2, https://www.cs.cmu.edu/~fp/courses/15816-s12/misc/andreoli92jlc.pdf (page images checked); propositional restriction","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","proof_status":"local structural construction checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-focusing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-focusing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-focusing — Focusing"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a70f24e0154f1736\" href=\"?note=a70f24e0154f1736\" title=\"72-df-linear-logic\">72-df-linear-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a77f51439d01d542\" href=\"?note=a77f51439d01d542\" title=\"72-df-types-inference-closure\">72-df-types-inference-closure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Supplement: Andreoli, Logic Programming with Focusing Proofs in Linear Logic, JLC 2(3) (1992) 297–347, author manuscript pp.8–12, Fig.4, Theorems1–2, <a href=\"https://www.cs.cmu.edu/~fp/courses/15816-s12/misc/andreoli92jlc.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.cs.cmu.edu/~fp/courses/15816-s12/misc/andreoli92jlc.pdf</a> (page images checked); propositional restriction"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local structural construction checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-focusing-—-Andreoli-Focusing\">df-focusing — Andreoli Focusing</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a70f24e0154f1736\" href=\"?note=a70f24e0154f1736\" title=\"72-df-linear-logic\">72-df-linear-logic</a> 的完整命题公式、多重集、字面量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p^+,p^-\">\\(p^+,p^-\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta,\\Gamma,\\Delta\">\\(\\Theta,\\Gamma,\\Delta\\)</span> 为有限多重集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 为有限有序公式表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,A\">\\(L,A\\)</span> 表示尾部添加。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Delta\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Delta\\)</span> 的支撑不含异步公式。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 遍历正原子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p^+\">\\(p^+\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L\">\\(\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Downarrow A\">\\(\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Downarrow A\\)</span> 是下式定义的判断编码，在规则分数内也表示该编码；载体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_f\">\\(U_f\\)</span> 在下式以有限多重集及公式表显式构造，规则分数与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cl}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cl}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a77f51439d01d542\" href=\"?note=a77f51439d01d542\" title=\"72-df-types-inference-closure\">72-df-types-inference-closure</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\">\\(\\Theta\\)</span> 储存去掉?外层的无限制资源；以下完整规则定义可导性，不假设已有聚焦谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal A&amp;:=\\{A\\mathbin{⅋}B,A\\mathbin{\\&amp;}B,\\bot,\\top,?A:A,B\\in\\mathcal F_{LL}\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal S&amp;:=\\{A\\otimes B,A\\oplus B,\\mathbf1,\\mathbf0,!A:A,B\\in\\mathcal F_{LL}\\},\\quad\\mathcal P:=\\{p^+:p\\in P\\},\\quad\\mathcal N:=\\{p^-:p\\in P\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal A&amp;:=\\{A\\mathbin{⅋}B,A\\mathbin{\\&amp;}B,\\bot,\\top,?A:A,B\\in\\mathcal F_{LL}\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal S&amp;:=\\{A\\otimes B,A\\oplus B,\\mathbf1,\\mathbf0,!A:A,B\\in\\mathcal F_{LL}\\},\\quad\\mathcal P:=\\{p^+:p\\in P\\},\\quad\\mathcal N:=\\{p^-:p\\in P\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{supp}(\\Gamma)&amp;:=\\{A\\in\\mathcal F_{LL}:\\Gamma(A)\\ne0\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal M_f&amp;:=\\{\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal M:\\operatorname{supp}(\\Gamma)\\cap\\mathcal A=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n(\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L)&amp;:=\\langle0,\\langle\\Theta,\\Gamma,L\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\n(\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Downarrow A)&amp;:=\\langle1,\\langle\\Theta,\\Gamma,A\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\nU_f&amp;:=\\{\\langle0,\\langle\\Theta,\\Gamma,L\\rangle\\rangle:\\Theta\\in\\mathcal M,\\ \\Gamma\\in\\mathcal M_f,\\ L\\in\\mathcal F_{LL}^{&lt;\\omega}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle1,\\langle\\Theta,\\Gamma,A\\rangle\\rangle:\\Theta\\in\\mathcal M,\\ \\Gamma\\in\\mathcal M_f,\\ A\\in\\mathcal F_{LL}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{supp}(\\Gamma)&amp;:=\\{A\\in\\mathcal F_{LL}:\\Gamma(A)\\ne0\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal M_f&amp;:=\\{\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal M:\\operatorname{supp}(\\Gamma)\\cap\\mathcal A=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n(\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L)&amp;:=\\langle0,\\langle\\Theta,\\Gamma,L\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\n(\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Downarrow A)&amp;:=\\langle1,\\langle\\Theta,\\Gamma,A\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\nU_f&amp;:=\\{\\langle0,\\langle\\Theta,\\Gamma,L\\rangle\\rangle:\\Theta\\in\\mathcal M,\\ \\Gamma\\in\\mathcal M_f,\\ L\\in\\mathcal F_{LL}^{&lt;\\omega}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle1,\\langle\\Theta,\\Gamma,A\\rangle\\rangle:\\Theta\\in\\mathcal M,\\ \\Gamma\\in\\mathcal M_f,\\ A\\in\\mathcal F_{LL}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nR_f^0:=&amp;\\left\\{\\frac{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L}{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L,\\bot},\\quad\\frac{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L,A,B}{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L,A\\mathbin{⅋}B},\\quad\\frac{\\Theta,A:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L}{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L,?A},\\quad\\frac{}{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L,\\top}\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L,A\\quad\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L,B}{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L,A\\mathbin{\\&amp;}B}\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{}{\\Theta:0_{\\mathcal M}\\Downarrow\\mathbf1},\\quad\\frac{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Downarrow A\\quad\\Theta:\\Delta\\Downarrow B}{\\Theta:\\Gamma,\\Delta\\Downarrow A\\otimes B},\\quad\\frac{\\Theta:0_{\\mathcal M}\\Uparrow\\langle A\\rangle}{\\Theta:0_{\\mathcal M}\\Downarrow!A}\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Downarrow A_i}{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Downarrow A_0\\oplus A_1}:i\\in\\{0,1\\}\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Theta:\\Gamma,A\\Uparrow L}{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L,A}:A\\notin\\mathcal A\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow\\langle A\\rangle}{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Downarrow A}:A\\notin\\mathcal S\\cup\\mathcal N\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{}{\\Theta:[X]\\Downarrow X^\\perp},\\quad\\frac{}{\\Theta,X:0_{\\mathcal M}\\Downarrow X^\\perp}:X\\in\\mathcal P\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Downarrow A}{\\Theta:\\Gamma,A\\Uparrow\\langle\\rangle}:A\\notin\\mathcal P\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Theta,A:\\Gamma\\Downarrow A}{\\Theta,A:\\Gamma\\Uparrow\\langle\\rangle}:A\\notin\\mathcal P\\right\\},\\\\\nR_f&amp;:=R_f^0\\cap(U_f^{&lt;\\omega}\\times U_f),\\\\\n\\vdash_f j&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow j\\in\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_f}(R_f),\\qquad\\mathsf{Focusing}:=\\langle U_f,R_f\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nR_f^0:=&amp;\\left\\{\\frac{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L}{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L,\\bot},\\quad\\frac{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L,A,B}{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L,A\\mathbin{⅋}B},\\quad\\frac{\\Theta,A:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L}{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L,?A},\\quad\\frac{}{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L,\\top}\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L,A\\quad\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L,B}{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L,A\\mathbin{\\&amp;}B}\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{}{\\Theta:0_{\\mathcal M}\\Downarrow\\mathbf1},\\quad\\frac{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Downarrow A\\quad\\Theta:\\Delta\\Downarrow B}{\\Theta:\\Gamma,\\Delta\\Downarrow A\\otimes B},\\quad\\frac{\\Theta:0_{\\mathcal M}\\Uparrow\\langle A\\rangle}{\\Theta:0_{\\mathcal M}\\Downarrow!A}\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Downarrow A_i}{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Downarrow A_0\\oplus A_1}:i\\in\\{0,1\\}\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Theta:\\Gamma,A\\Uparrow L}{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L,A}:A\\notin\\mathcal A\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow\\langle A\\rangle}{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Downarrow A}:A\\notin\\mathcal S\\cup\\mathcal N\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{}{\\Theta:[X]\\Downarrow X^\\perp},\\quad\\frac{}{\\Theta,X:0_{\\mathcal M}\\Downarrow X^\\perp}:X\\in\\mathcal P\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Downarrow A}{\\Theta:\\Gamma,A\\Uparrow\\langle\\rangle}:A\\notin\\mathcal P\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Theta,A:\\Gamma\\Downarrow A}{\\Theta,A:\\Gamma\\Uparrow\\langle\\rangle}:A\\notin\\mathcal P\\right\\},\\\\\nR_f&amp;:=R_f^0\\cap(U_f^{&lt;\\omega}\\times U_f),\\\\\n\\vdash_f j&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow j\\in\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_f}(R_f),\\qquad\\mathsf{Focusing}:=\\langle U_f,R_f\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>2026-10-23载体补全：两种判断使用互异的自然数标签；线性储存区的支撑限制是载体的一部分，异步栈仍允许所有公式。Θ允许任意有限多重集。候选规则最后与载体上的有限前提关系相交；例如决定规则中只有可放入线性储存区的公式才形成实际实例。储存非异步公式、同步阶段拆分资源和清空线性区的原规则均在该载体内。没有把可导性当作载体成员资格。</p>\n<p>逐项对照Andreoli Fig.4的命题实例。负原子聚焦只能由两个原子identity关闭；同步分解后遇到正原子或异步公式释放焦点。?将公式储存到Theta，!要求线性多重集清空。异步层采用有序栈，避免把单条规则序列误作任意分支证明的聚焦定义。底层仍为单侧LL，不含额外一般弱化规则。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-focusing-—-Andreoli-Focusing","text":"df-focusing — Andreoli Focusing","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-linear-logic","status":"resolved","id":"a70f24e0154f1736","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-linear-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-types-inference-closure","status":"resolved","id":"a77f51439d01d542","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-types-inference-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-linear-logic","status":"resolved","id":"a70f24e0154f1736","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-linear-logic]] 的完整命题公式、多重集、字面量 $p^+,p^-$；$\\Theta,\\Gamma,\\Delta$ 为有限多重集，$L$ 为有限有序公式表，$L,A$ 表示尾部添加。$\\Gamma,\\Delta$ 的支撑不含异步公式。$X$ 遍历正原子 $p^+$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-types-inference-closure","status":"resolved","id":"a77f51439d01d542","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L$ 与 $\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Downarrow A$ 是下式定义的判断编码，在规则分数内也表示该编码；载体 $U_f$ 在下式以有限多重集及公式表显式构造，规则分数与 $\\operatorname{Cl}$ 取 [[72-df-types-inference-closure]]。$\\Theta$ 储存去掉?外层的无限制资源；以下完整规则定义可导性，不假设已有聚焦谓词。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p^+,p^-","display":false},{"tex":"\\Theta,\\Gamma,\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"L,A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"p^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L","display":false},{"tex":"\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Downarrow A","display":false},{"tex":"U_f","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cl}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal A&:=\\{A\\mathbin{⅋}B,A\\mathbin{\\&}B,\\bot,\\top,?A:A,B\\in\\mathcal F_{LL}\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal S&:=\\{A\\otimes B,A\\oplus B,\\mathbf1,\\mathbf0,!A:A,B\\in\\mathcal F_{LL}\\},\\quad\\mathcal P:=\\{p^+:p\\in P\\},\\quad\\mathcal N:=\\{p^-:p\\in P\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{supp}(\\Gamma)&:=\\{A\\in\\mathcal F_{LL}:\\Gamma(A)\\ne0\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal M_f&:=\\{\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal M:\\operatorname{supp}(\\Gamma)\\cap\\mathcal A=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n(\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L)&:=\\langle0,\\langle\\Theta,\\Gamma,L\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\n(\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Downarrow A)&:=\\langle1,\\langle\\Theta,\\Gamma,A\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\nU_f&:=\\{\\langle0,\\langle\\Theta,\\Gamma,L\\rangle\\rangle:\\Theta\\in\\mathcal M,\\ \\Gamma\\in\\mathcal M_f,\\ L\\in\\mathcal F_{LL}^{<\\omega}\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle1,\\langle\\Theta,\\Gamma,A\\rangle\\rangle:\\Theta\\in\\mathcal M,\\ \\Gamma\\in\\mathcal M_f,\\ A\\in\\mathcal F_{LL}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nR_f^0:=&\\left\\{\\frac{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L}{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L,\\bot},\\quad\\frac{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L,A,B}{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L,A\\mathbin{⅋}B},\\quad\\frac{\\Theta,A:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L}{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L,?A},\\quad\\frac{}{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L,\\top}\\right\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L,A\\quad\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L,B}{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L,A\\mathbin{\\&}B}\\right\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{}{\\Theta:0_{\\mathcal M}\\Downarrow\\mathbf1},\\quad\\frac{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Downarrow A\\quad\\Theta:\\Delta\\Downarrow B}{\\Theta:\\Gamma,\\Delta\\Downarrow A\\otimes B},\\quad\\frac{\\Theta:0_{\\mathcal M}\\Uparrow\\langle A\\rangle}{\\Theta:0_{\\mathcal M}\\Downarrow!A}\\right\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Downarrow A_i}{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Downarrow A_0\\oplus A_1}:i\\in\\{0,1\\}\\right\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Theta:\\Gamma,A\\Uparrow L}{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow L,A}:A\\notin\\mathcal A\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Uparrow\\langle A\\rangle}{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Downarrow A}:A\\notin\\mathcal S\\cup\\mathcal N\\right\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{}{\\Theta:[X]\\Downarrow X^\\perp},\\quad\\frac{}{\\Theta,X:0_{\\mathcal M}\\Downarrow X^\\perp}:X\\in\\mathcal P\\right\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Theta:\\Gamma\\Downarrow A}{\\Theta:\\Gamma,A\\Uparrow\\langle\\rangle}:A\\notin\\mathcal P\\right\\}\\cup\\left\\{\\frac{\\Theta,A:\\Gamma\\Downarrow A}{\\Theta,A:\\Gamma\\Uparrow\\langle\\rangle}:A\\notin\\mathcal P\\right\\},\\\\\nR_f&:=R_f^0\\cap(U_f^{<\\omega}\\times U_f),\\\\\n\\vdash_f j&:\\Longleftrightarrow j\\in\\operatorname{Cl}_{U_f}(R_f),\\qquad\\mathsf{Focusing}:=\\langle U_f,R_f\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":4822,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-431","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-focusing|df-focusing — Focusing]]"},{"id":"6d1ce606432d6e21","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[72-df-focusing]] 的 $U_f,R_f,\\mathcal A$ 及 $\\vdash_f$；$\\Theta,\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal M$、$\\operatorname{supp}(\\Gamma)\\cap\\mathcal A=\\varnothing$，$L\\in\\mathcal F_{LL}^{<\\omega}$。$?\\Theta$ 与 $\\vdash_{LL}$ 见 [[72-df-linear-logic]]。"}],"outgoing":["a70f24e0154f1736","a77f51439d01d542"]}